osting. the plan is to boost two posts initially, then analyze performance before boosting more.", "dashboard template creation & team shadowing: rohan assigned yogita the task of creating dashboard templates for various e-commerce metrics (inventory, performance marketing, general). he requested templates at different levels of detail (l1, l2, l3). rohan wants the tech team to build the dashboards based on yogita's templates. yogita will also shadow calls to understand team workflows and processes. this is a learning and development opportunity for yogita to contribute to the team.", "content feedback & copywriting (glow mist): sameera asks if changes suggested by gayatri have been made. yogita asks sameera to scroll down to review the copy. discussion of replacing words in the copy (e.g., 'not glam' to 'no glam'). yogita suggests sameera review copywriting examples to improve output. discussion of different wording options ('glow naturally' preferred). emphasis on the importance of good copywriting skills.", "content updates and feedback loop: yogita mentions making changes to a post based on previous feedback. offer to show the updated post. demonstrates a commitment to incorporating feedback and improving content. highlights the importance of a collaborative content creation process. open communication and willingness to adapt based on suggestions.", "dashboard template project & team understanding: rohan assigns yogita a project to create dashboard templates for different e-commerce metrics (inventory, performance marketing, general). the goal is to provide templates for the tech team to build actual dashboards. rohan also instructs yogita to shadow team calls to gain a better understanding of ongoing work. discussion about the need for yogita to understand the team's processes and objectives. rohan confirms that the dashboard templates are a priority for yogita.", "post selection confirmation & final thoughts: yogita asks for confirmation of the preferred posts for boosting. the team confirms the selection of the introductory post and the voiceover reel. discussion of additional posts to consider, including aesthetic videos. yogita emphasizes the importance of regular boosting until the product launch. rohan offers to create a dashboard template to automate the tracking of key metrics. the team expresses a commitment to monitoring performance and optimizing the boosting strategy. final confirmation of the initial post selection and a plan to move forward with the boosting campaign.", "daily routine & stand-up meetings: rohan outlined the daily routine, including two core stand-up meetings at 11:15 am and 6:00 pm. separate tech stand-ups are conducted due to departmental differences. a growth stand-up is held at 8:00 pm, catering to intern availability. the new hire (harsh) will initially shadow rohan in stand-up meetings. rohan emphasized the importance of understanding the project and being able to answer basic questions. the goal is to transition the new hire into a position where they can lead stand-up meetings independently. discussion of the onboarding process and the importance of clear communication. rohan highlighted the need for the new hire to quickly grasp the project context.", "daily routine & stand-up meetings: rohan outlines the daily routine, including two core stand-up meetings (11:15 am and 6:00 pm). separate tech stand-ups are conducted due to departmental differences. a growth stand-up is held at 8:00 pm, catering to intern availability. the new hire will initially shadow rohan in stand-up meetings. rohan emphasizes the importance of understanding the project and being able to answer basic questions. the goal is to transition the new hire into a position where they can lead stand-up meetings independently. discussion of the onboarding process and the importance of clear communication.", "daily routine & stand-up meetings: rohan outlines the daily routine including two core stand-up meetings at 11:15 a