nt for Debugging Data Pipeline Failures", "points": ["Isha presented a second project idea: an AI agent to debug data pipeline failures, specifically in ETL processes.", "The problem identified is silent or cryptic failures in ETL pipelines, making debugging difficult.", "Isha described experiencing issues with Airbyte and data loading times.", "The AI agent would analyze logs, identify the root cause of failures, and suggest fixes.", "The agent would leverage NLP and failure classification to pinpoint issues.", "Isha emphasized the importance of detailed log checking and training the model on accurate data.", "Rohan highlighted the potential of this project, especially considering a similar process already exists (NATN).", "Chayan suggested the project aligns well with Isha's skills and experience.", "Discussion on the need to define project scope and create a detailed documentation.", "Emphasis on the importance of capturing various error types for model training."], "end_time": "16:15", "start_time": "14:43", "time_range": "14:43 - 16:15", "participants": ["Isha Joshi", "Rohan Kumar", "Chayan Roy"]}, {"topic": "Training Data for AI Debugging Agent", "points": ["Significant discussion around the challenges of generating a training dataset for the AI debugging agent.", "The dataset needs to accurately capture various error types, warnings, and common logs.", "Differentiating between these categories is crucial for model performance.", "Isha emphasized the importance of a high-quality dataset for training an effective model.", "Discussion on the use of coding LLMs for debugging.", "The need to capture all types of errors to train the model effectively.", "Importance of capturing the nuances between errors, warnings, and normal logs."], "end_time": "17:33", "start_time": "16:16", "time_range": "16:16 - 17:33", "participants": ["Isha Joshi", "Rohan Kumar", "Chayan Roy"]}, {"topic": "Harsh's Work & Dashboard Templates", "points": ["Rohan mentioned Harsh requested docum