ches: aryan dev explained how he would approach creating dashboards or predicting sales based on scraped website data, using either python or sql + power bi.\\n  • discussion of project experience: aryan dev described several projects including an instagram database analytics project, a movie recommendation system, and web scraping for times of india and amazon. he demonstrated experience with data manipulation libraries like pandas and numpy.\\n  • rohan will provide ayush with a real account (travel company selling esims) by monday for data analysis.\\n\\n⚠️ Open Concerns:\\n  • ensuring sahil understands the pristyn care brand aesthetic before starting any work.\\n  • harsh's potential concerns about compensation and career progression (addressed by rohan's commitment to mentorship).\\n  • confirming the reach and engagement of potential influencers.\\n  • aligning sahil's skills with pristyn care's diverse design approach.\\n  • dependence on harsh sharma to build functionalities, potentially creating a bottleneck.\\n  • ensuring harsh feels supported and has opportunities for growth.\\n  • the importance of mentorship in accelerating career progression.\\n  • ensuring a clear and consistent understanding of marketing efficiency metrics.\\n  • lack of data on target audience behavior may lead to ineffective ad campaigns.\\n  • the team needs to adapt their product strategy to reflect the 80/20 male/female spending split.\\n  • the potential for ineffective ad targeting if relying solely on instagram's algorithm.\\n  • the need to stay updated with frequent changes in google ads strategies.\\n  • need for the candidate to spend time learning current practices\\n  • the risk of wasting ad spend on ineffective campaigns.\\n  • candidate's reliance on pre-cleaned datasets in kaggle\\n  • data being retrieved from the database needs to be clarified.\\n  • database schema needs to be updated to include priority.\\n  • ensuring data accuracy and reliability.\\n  • ensu