ach to content promotion. the team is seeking collective wisdom on optimizing content performance.", "instagram ad account setup & boosting: yogita inquired about connecting✪instagram ads to facebook account vs. creating a separate instagram ad account. rohan advised using the existing facebook account for easier data pulling and integration with existing dashboards. yogita confirmed the budget is already set up in the facebook ad account. discussion of payment methods (upi) within the facebook ad account. yogita plans to initially boost existing posts to increase follower count, as organic reach hasn't yielded results despite consistent posting since october 2nd. rohan asked yogita's team to determine which posts to boost and provide a rationale. confirmation that rohan set up the ad in the morning. troubleshooting link sharing in the call chat - yogita had difficulty sharing the link. discussion of potential glitches with instagram/facebook link sharing. yogita mentioned a need to ensure the payment method is correctly linked to the facebook ad account. confirmation of facebook ad account setup and data integration for dashboard creation.", "boost campaign & payment: request to approve a boost campaign payment of 10,000 rupees. yogita will share a qr code for payment. discussion of the launch date (around february 26th or 27th). rohan is unavailable from february 22nd onwards. goal is to complete the launch design before february 21st. yogita confirms rohan's unavailability from february 22nd to the end of february. discussion of a tentative launch date around february 26th or 27th.", "daily routine & stand-up meetings: rohan outlines the daily routine, including two core stand-up meetings (11:15 am and 6:00 pm). separate tech stand-ups are conducted due to departmental differences. a growth stand-up is held at 8:00 pm, catering to intern availability. the new hire will initially shadow rohan in stand-up meetings. rohan emphasizes the importance of understanding t