tent performance.", "content launch & finalization: rohan asks about the status of content launch preparations. yogita confirms the content is finalized and has been discussed with rubik. some posts have already been assigned to interns. discussion about a content calendar for the launch. yogita confirms the website content, crm messages, and emailers are finalized. gayathri had a discussion with rohan about a privacy policy for the website. yogita confirms the content is finalized and has been discussed with rubik. discussion about a content calendar for the launch. yogita confirms the content is finalized and has been discussed with rubik.", "scheduling & availability - yogita & sameera: sameera mentions her 'start stand-up' doesn't happen in the evening. she plans to connect with yogita separately because she won't be at home in the evening. this indicates a need to coordinate schedules and find a time that works for both sameera and yogita. there's an implicit acknowledgment of the challenges of coordinating schedules with remote or busy team members. this is a logistical concern that needs to be addressed to ensure effective communication and collaboration. the team is aiming for a collaborative approach to content creation. emphasis on sharing ideas and building upon each other's work. the team is trying to distribute tasks based on individual skills and interests. the team is encouraging each member to take ownership of specific content areas.", "mascot design brainstorming & visual references: brainstorming session for the mascot design. emphasis on a cute, simple, and recognizable character. yogita suggests a 'puffy' character. discussion about avoiding overly feminine or gendered designs. sharing visual references (avocado illustration) for inspiration. radhika's previous design was considered too detailed.", "bifold design & content confirmation (round 2): rohan discusses the bifold design with akashian and nika. the design involves a logo and artist collaboration. they need to confirm the content order: logo/text vs. text/logo. discussion about including a qr code or handle on the design. rohan mentioned the need to confirm content with akashian and nika. discussion about the placement of the artist's name and logo. they are collaborating with christian forest for the artist collaboration.", "bifold design & content confirmation (round 1): discussion of the bifold design with akash and nika. the design involves a logo and artist collaboration. need to confirm the content order: logo/text vs. text/logo. discussion about including a qr code or handle on the design. rohan mentioned the need to confirm content with akashian and nika. discussion about the placement of the artist's name and logo. they are collaborating with christian forest for the artist collaboration.", "bifold design & content confirmation: discussion of the bifold design with akash and nika. the design involves a logo and artist collaboration. need to confirm the content order: logo/text vs. text/logo. discussion about including a qr code or handle on the design. rohan mentioned the need to confirm content with akashian and nika. discussion about the placement of the artist's name and logo. they are collaborating with christian forest for the artist collaboration. dhruvik inquired about providing ai or pdf files for the bifold design. gayatri suggested providing ai files for manipulation and pdf files for final output. rohan requested both ai and pdf files for flexibility.", "initial discussion - ai image generation issues & mascot feedback: yogita received feedback on an ai-generated mascot image that was deemed 'too fairy' and not relatable. the mascot needed to be less feminine and appeal to a broader audience. the image was initially sent to rohan for feedback before being shared with the marketing group. the mascot was described as 'maximal' with too much ieration and detail. dhruvik asked the designer to rework the image, minimizing the details. rohan mentioned the image was a significant miss in terms of design direction.", "content creation & weekly planning: dhruvik mentions preview version ready for a reel. dhruvik will add content for weeks three and four. dhruvik and yogita will connect to discuss remaining monthly content. akash and akshar will be unavailable for two-three days. discussion of content for the upcoming week and ensuring timely completion. focus on proactive content creation to stay ahead of schedule. emphasis on collaboration between team members to streamline the content process.", "stand-up meeting recap: the stand-up meeting involved mariam and samira. they discussed brands being followed and the content calendar progress. gayatri provided feedback on tracking brand activities and post ideas. the team will document brand activities for future reference. the stand-up focused on progress and feedback related to the content calendar.", "initial project discussion & budget confirmation: gayatri and sidra are discussing starting a project immediately. the project's feasibility is contingent on budget availability. if the project exceeds the current budget, it will be postponed to the next or following month. sidra confirms she is 'on it' and will send an email detailing the discussed points. sidra will allow gayatri to choose key concept products to begin with. gayatri requests sidra's email address. sidra confirms she will send her email address via whatsapp chat. both express hope for a long-term working relationship. they conclude the conversation with well wishes and a 'bye-bye'.", "content status & ahili update: dhruvik inquires about updates from ahili regarding content. aakarshi will follow up with ahili. discussion about content readiness for the card design. emphasis on obtaining the content promptly. content is needed to proceed with the design process.", "project onboarding & task assignment - artist collaboration feature: discussion of the artist collaboration feature and h