form for sample testing.", "Exploring how to collaborate with Smitten for their sample testing program.", "Researching alternative sample testing platforms in India.", "Analyzing the cost and logistics of running a sample testing program.", "Exploring the potential of using samples to drive sales and brand awareness.", "Discussing the importance of targeting the right audience with samples.", "Analyzing the effectiveness of different sampling methods.", "Exploring the idea of partnering with retailers to distribute samples.", "Discussing the importance of tracking the results of a sampling program.", "Analyzing the cost of producing and distributing samples.", "Exploring the idea of offering samples in exchange for customer feedback.", "Discussing the importance of ensuring the quality of samples.", "Analyzing the potential of using samples to generate leads."], "end_time": "57:35", "start_time": "55:11", "time_range": "55:11 - 57:35", "participants": ["Seema Samanta", "Maryam Fatima"]}, {"topic": "Mood Board Prioritization & Scheduling", "points": ["Maryam suggests postponing the mood board as a lower priority.", "Seema suggests communicating this prioritization to Rohan.", "Discussion about focusing on other tasks first.", "Seema proposes working on the mood board Thursday or Friday.", "Seema mentions she will be on leave from the 12th to the 19th due to midterm exams.", "Maryam confirms she can work on the mood board during her exams, but other tasks will be difficult.", "Both confirm similar exam schedules.", "Seema clarifies her return date as the 21st.", "Maryam confirms she'll be available on the 10th, 11th, 20th and 21st.", "Agreement to prioritize current tasks before revisiting the mood board.", "Seema reiterates the need to figure out the solid perfumes task."], "end_time": "69:18", "start_time": "68:16", "time_range": "68:16 - 69:18", "participants": ["Maryam Fatima", "Seema Samanta"]}, {"topic": "Exam Schedules & Availability Confirmation", "points": ["