nd of the conversation."], "end_time": "71:52", "start_time": "71:09", "time_range": "71:09 - 71:52", "participants": ["Maryam Fatima", "Seema Samanta"]}], "concerns": ["Overlapping exam schedules impacting workload capacity.", "Potential for limited availability due to exams (especially for Maryam).", "Need to balance work with exam preparation.", "Ensuring tasks are prioritized effectively given limited time.", "Seema’s uncertainty about taking leave and managing workload.", "Potential for needing to re-evaluate workload if exam schedules become more demanding."], "next_steps": ["Seema Samanta to Research cost of listing 5 vs. 50 products on Nika, Tira, Sephora. by unspecified", "Seema Samanta to Explore the 'Smitten' app and identify similar apps. by unspecified", "Rohan Kumar & Seema Samanta to Research Glossier and Dunk Elephant's D2C and marketplace strategies. by unspecified", "Rohan Kumar & Seema Samanta to Investigate the potential of performance marketing vs. social media engagement. by unspecified", "Seema Samanta to Determine the cost implications of listing products on marketplaces. by unspecified"], "action_items": [{"task": "Research cost of listing 5 vs. 50 products on Nika, Tira, Sephora.", "deadline": "unspecified", "priority": "high", "timestamp": "Throughout the conversation", "confidence": 0.95, "responsible": "Seema Samanta"}, {"task": "Work on TWT, the smitten thing, and the questionnaire.", "deadline": "Unspecified", "priority": "high", "timestamp": "Mentioned throughout the call", "confidence": 0.95, "responsible": "Maryam Fatima"}, {"task": "Work on Glossier analysis.", "deadline": "Unspecified", "priority": "high", "timestamp": "Mentioned at the end of the call", "confidence": 0.95, "responsible": "Seema Samanta"}, {"task": "Work on NICA cost structure of advertisement.", "deadline": "Unspecified", "priority": "high", "timestamp": "Mentioned at the end of the call", "confidence": 0.95, "responsible": "Seema Samanta"}, {"task": "Work on inc