the strategies of brands like Glossier and Dunk Elephant regarding D2C presence, marketplace placement, and community building.", "Rohan and Seema will investigate the potential of using performance marketing (Google/Meta ads) versus social media engagement to drive traffic to the website.", "Maryam will prioritize TWT, the smitten thing, and the questionnaire.", "Seema will work on Glossier analysis, NICA cost structure of advertisement, incubator analysis, and updating her guesstimate.", "The mood board will be deprioritized and potentially worked on Thursday or Friday.", "Acknowledgement of overlapping exam schedules for Maryam and Seema impacting workload availability."], "engagement_metrics": {"most_active": "Rohan Kumar", "speaker_stats": {"Rohan Kumar": {"words": 4331, "questions": 14, "utterances": 169}, "Maryam Fatima": {"words": 1645, "questions": 9, "utterances": 82}, "Seema Samanta": {"words": 2589, "questions": 8, "utterances": 129}}, "total_utterances": 380}, "historical_context": {"topics": ["rohan's past experience with a rapidly growing organization.", "daily stand-up meetings and communication.", "evening stand-up meeting", "discussion of design stand-up from prior meetings", "rohan’s availability for a brief team connection", "rohan's commitment to supporting harsh's development.", "discussion of the indian market and positioning strategy.", "luxury beauty market size and growth in india (estimated at 0.8 billion)", "sharing of a link to pf.growthsupercharge.com.", "brand aesthetics (pristyn care/christian forest)", "product classification in the luxury beauty market (fragrances, perfumes)", "artist logo/signature (pankaj saroj - digital signature vs. name)", "budget allocation (3 lakhs) and scaling strategy.", "harsh sharma's work on building functionalities.", "importance of seizing opportunities for growth.", "general check-in on advertising progress", "the concept of starting from zero and scaling up gradually.", "company's ability to build everything in-house", "d2c brand tech stack comparison", "<unused5784> trends in luxury beauty purchases (mini/travel size products)", "seema offering support and clarification to harsh.", "review of previously presented holy post ideas (maryam and viraj)", "discussion of ongoing work on a specific project."], "action_items": ["rohan kumar & dhruvik bamniya to rohan and dhruvik to connect before evening stand-up to discuss dashboards. by Before evening stand-up", "rohan kumar to rohan kumar to share the link to pf.growthsupercharge.com with the team. by immediately", "rohan kumar & yogita nagpal to discuss boosting a post. by Morning (unspecified date)", "rohan kumar to rohan to continue providing guidance and support to esha. by Ongoing", "rohan kumar to connect at 6:00 pm for introduction of 'hush'. by today at 6:00 PM", "rohan kumar to address harsh's concerns about compensation and career progression. by Ongoing", "rohan kumar to rohan to answer tagged questions on yellow (social media) after harsh is onboarded. by After Harsh's onboarding", "rohan kumar to push the design team to generate assets from the website. by ongoing", "rohan kumar to review articles for understanding gtm strategies of minimalist, derma co. etc. by unspecified", "rohan kumar to secure two paying clients for harshh. by unspecified", "rohan kumar to investigate brand advertising choices (google/meta vs. amazon/myntra) for roi. by unspecified", "dhruvik bamniya & rohan kumar (collaborative) to generate background for face mist and body mist products. by Unspecified, prioritized after other updates", "harsh & rohan kumar to harsh and rohan to build a social media dashboard for analyzing boosted post data. by unspecified", "seema samanta to seema samanta to refine cohort segmentation based on mutually exclusive income brackets. by unspecified", "seema samanta to seema samanta to毁灭 the data and recalculate percentages for aspirational premium buyers. by unspecified", "rohan kumar to review seema's gtm strategy document (gtm2 section) for insights. by unspecified", "seema samanta/rohan kumar to investigate the validity of the 80% population with a pci of 1.2 or 1.3 lakhs. by unspecified", "rohan kumar to rohan to share the document outlining 6-7 necessary metrics. by unspecified", "rohan kumar to rohan to investigate confidence levels in ai-generated results. by Not specified", "rohan kumar to review ayush's google analytics documentation. by After Ayush completes documentation", "seema samanta & mariam to seema and mariam to research gtm strategies of brands launched in the last 5 years, focusing on marketplace adoption. by unspecified", "gayatri ramdas to gayatri to review brand's social media posts and competitor posts (molten beauty) for tone/style references. by Ongoing", "gayatri ramdas to gayatri to refine writing tone to align with brandfocused on using a tone consistent with the brand's existing social media posts and those of competitor brands like molten beauty. by Ongoing", "seema samanta to research male-specific product options for the luxury beauty market. by unspecified", "dhruvik bamniya to dhruvik to add anika to the growth consultancy divalent ui/ux project group. by Soon", "viraj, gayatri, sameera to viraj, gayatri, and sameera to research newer/up-and-coming brands for content inspiration. by 3-4 week period", "maryam fatima to maryam to create a table outlining gaps in quora content. by Tomorrow", "team to team to review the tasks outlined in the shared document (pf.growthsupercharge.com). by within the next couple of weeks", "mariam fatima, samira parveen to share ideas for world ngo day story in group chat. by Today", "maryam fatima & sameera parveen to share and discuss content inspiration (reels, posts, visuals) with the team.", "rohan kumar to connect with maryam to align on incubator/grant analysis. by unspecified", "seema samanta to analyze effectiveness of gtm strategies (google/meta vs. e-commerce platforms). by Tomorrow", "seema samanta to seema to provide context to harsh about the incubator and grant discussion. by Soon", "esha joshi to esha joshi to continue building custom dashboards for campaign analysis and deeper retention insights. by unspecified", "rohan to rohan to send harsh the link to the design stand-up meeting. by Soon"], "open_concerns": ["harsh's potential concerns about compensation and career progression (addressed by rohan's commitment to mentorship).", "the importance of clear communication between rohan and varun.", "need for clear communication and collaboration between ishneet and gayatri.", "availability of team members for discussion (sameera not at home in the evening).", "potential delays if harsh sharma encounters roadblocks while building functionalities.", "rohan's limited time due to school commitments.", "potential for miscommunication regarding content updates.", "ensuring sahil understands the pristyn care brand aesthetic before starting any work.", "potential challenges in identifying products that align with janvi's creative style.", "ensuring janvi understands the brand's products and ingredients.", "pressure on the design team to deliver high-quality work for the e-commerce brand", "pressure on the design team to deliver high-quality work for the e-commerce brand.", "ensuring harsh feels supported and has opportunities for growth.", "dependence on harsh sharma to build functionalities, potentially creating a bottleneck.", "the team needs to adapt their product strategy to reflect the 80/20 male/female spending split.", "the need to ensure that the company's tech stack is able to scale to meet future demand", "confirming the reach and engagement of potential influencers.", "the challenge of scaling up from zero with a fresh account.", "the initial assumption of a female-dominated luxury fragrance market may be incorrect.", "need for more content ideas to increase the likelihood of approval.", "pressure to generate enough content options.", "assessing the scope of work and potential for long-term collaboration."], "prior_decisions": ["rohan will set up a call with seema, mariam, and rohit to standardize the incubator evaluation process. he will attempt to join the call.", "rohan and dhruvik will connect before the evening stand-up to discuss dashboards.", "rohan will connect with chayan and dhruvik separately to discuss further.", "gayatri will discuss the launch date with rohan (likely the founder/decision-maker) and try to reach a consensus.", "rohan will share the link to pf.growthsupercharge.com with the team (implied decision based on his statement and harsh's request to review it).", "rohan will address harsh's concerns about compensation and career progression by providing mentorship and opportunities for growth.", "rohan kumar will connect at 6:00 pm for an introduction of 'hush' to the team before leaving.", "rohan will share product information (ingredients, etc.) with janvi to familiarize her with the brand's offerings.", "rohan will review articles seema mentioned to understand the gtm strategies of brands like minimalist and derma co.", "rohan will continue to push the design team to generate assets from the website instead of relying solely on freepik.", "rohan will share previous dashboard templates for harshh to review and use as a starting point for creating e-commerce dashboard templates.", "viraj will create visuals for a skincare campaign, inspired by a cocktail/perfume concept but adapted to desserts.", "agreement on a 30,000 rupee budget for the first month of ugc content creation.", "ayush will share his screen to explain the user retention cohort chart to rohan.", "yogita will try two more boosted posts with a 10,000 rupee budget.", "rohan kumar will procure a small monitor (2-3k) for his setup.", "rohan will provide a dashboard template for tracking boosting metrics (followers, likes, engagement).", "rohan will provide a dashboard template for tracking boosting metrics (followers, likes, etc.).", "rohan will share a document outlining 6-7 necessary metrics to calculate.", "the team will research indian consumer awareness of certifications like cosmos to determine if pursuing the certification is worthwhile.", "rohan will share information with yogita regarding their projects and establish a baseline for output.", "seema will analyze which gtm strategies (google/meta ads vs. e-commerce platforms) were more effective for brands launched in the last five years.", "seema and mariam will research gtm strategies of newer (launched in the last 5 years) brands to understand marketplace adoption strategies.", "dhruvik will add anika to the growth consultancy website ui/ux project group (along with haley).", "sameera will continue adding influencers (both nano and micro) to the list, aiming for around 20 total.", "kaitri (glossy glam) is a potential influencer; alternatives are being explored.", "seema will research male-specific product options and harsh will contribute ideas (after shave, etc.).", "the team will share the incubator analysis document in the growth group, tagging rohit and mariam for collaboration.", "mariam and samira provided updates during the stand-up about brand following and content calendar progress.", "the team will meet tomorrow to brainstorm additional ideas for women's day and holy posts, acknowledging that approval for the holy post ideas previously shown by maryam and viraj is not guaranteed.", "daily stand-up meetings will be held at 6:30 pm for discussion and updates.", "rohan will connect with maryam to align on the analysis of incubators and grants.", "maryam and sameera will continue to share and discuss content inspiration (reels, posts, visuals) for potential adaptation.", "rohan will review seema's gtm strategy document (gtm2 section) and look for interesting insights to discuss.", "ishnit will explore different setups and shots for each product, utilizing both the provided mood boards and her own creative input.", "the team acknowledged the previous presentation of holy post ideas by maryam and viraj but decided to generate more options to increase the chances of approval.", "rohan will continue to push for dashboard completion and expects esha to adhere to timelines or ask for help immediately."], "meeting_segments": ["follow-up discussion & time availability: rohan kumar requested time for a follow-up discussion. he inquired about chayan roy's availability. rohan kumar indicated a desire to discuss further details. the request suggests a need for more in-depth conversation. the discussion highlights the importance of ongoing communication. rohan kumar is seeking to ensure alignment and address any remaining questions. the team is committed to maintaining open lines of communication. the follow-up discussion is intended to facilitate collaboration and problem-solving.", "stand-up meeting recap: the stand-up meeting involved mariam and samira. they discussed brands being followed and the content calendar progress. gayatri provided feedback on tracking brand activities and post ideas. the team will document brand activities for future reference. the stand-up focused on progress and feedback related to the content calendar.", "growth stand-up meetings & research depth: rohan explains that the growth stand-up meetings tend to be longer. he focuses on creating a deeper understanding of the research topics. rohan wants to ensure that team members can connect the dots and understand the context of their work. he believes that a more thorough explanation upfront saves time in the long run. rohan wants the team to understand the 'why' behind the research. he emphasizes the importance of connecting research to practical applications. the goal is to create a more informed and effective research process.", "general check-in and task assignment: rohan asked for a general check-in with the team. rohan instructed dinesh, choyeon, and guinness to stay back and clarify shubhang's doubts. the team will reconvene at the night stand-up. rohan provided concluding remarks. this segment served as a brief status update and task delegation. the focus was on resolving immediate issues and ensuring team alignment. the night stand-up is designated as the next meeting point for further discussion.", "daily routine & stand-up meetings: rohan outlines the daily routine, including two core stand-up meetings (11:15 am and 6:00 pm). separate tech stand-ups are conducted due to departmental differences. a growth stand-up is held at 8:00 pm, catering to intern availability. the new hire will initially shadow rohan in stand-up meetings. rohan emphasizes the importance of understanding the project and being able to answer basic questions. the goal is to transition the new hire into a position where they can lead stand-up meetings independently. discussion of the onboarding process and the importance of clear communication.", "historical context - prior decisions: rohan kumar will procure a small monitor (2-3k) for his setup. rohan will send harsh the link to the design stand-up meeting (shared on mattermost). rohan kumar will connect at 6:00 pm for an introduction of 'hush' to the team before leaving. rohan will share previous dashboard templates for harshh to review and use as a starting point for creating e-commerce dashboard templates. rohan will connect with chayan and dhruvik separately to discuss further. rohan will provide a dashboard template for tracking boosting metrics (followers, likes, etc.). rohan will discuss boosting a post with yogita in the morning. this segment summarized previously agreed-upon actions and decisions.", "akarshhan's absence from previous call & placement talk: rohan inquires about akarshhan's absence from a previous call. akarshhan explains he attended a placement talk with the director and guests. he assures rohan he will be able to join future calls. rohan acknowledges the explanation and confirms the next call is on friday.", "introduction & brand overview: rohan introduces pristyn forest as a self-care brand launching with four categories (body mist, body oils, essential oils데이트, face mists). they have 51 skus with variations in size. the brand aims to expand to three more categories soon (home diffusers, solid perfumes) and then candles and bathroom products. pristyn forest is a pre-launch, bootstrapped brand. they are looking for a long-term ugc content creator collaboration (4-6 months). they appreciate the aesthetic of the potential collaborator's instagram page. they are seeking approximately 10 assets per month.", "commercial discussion & budget: rohan outlines a budget range of 15k-35k per month for ugc content creation. they've previously onboarded creators at both ends of this range. they are aiming for a six-month contract, potentially extending to a longer term. the desired contract value is around 1.8-2 lakh for 60 videos. nourish nurture initially expresses a preference for 5k per asset. rohan explains the need for high-quality assets and the desire to own them. they discuss the possibility of a three-month initial contract. nourish nurture indicates willingness to consider a longer-term collaboration. rohan clarifies that the budget is constrained due to being a startup. there's a discussion about the equipment used for content creation (phone vs. dslr). rohan mentions previous negotiations with other creators and the challenges of balancing budget and quality. nourish nurture expresses understanding of the startup's financial constraints. rohan proposes a potential compromise for a three-month period.", "initial website link sharing & task overview: rohan kumar was not at pf.growthsupercharge.com. rohan kumar forgot to share the website link. rohan kumar intended to share the link immediately. harsh sharma clarified the website represented the core team's work. harsh sharma explained the website contained a task column. harsh sharma stated the team was gradually building functionality