ve. concern about wasting money on ineffective boosting. yogita paused a previous boosted ad after 5 days due to poor audience quality, but didn't delete it to preserve data. question about whether the full amount of a paused boosted ad was charged. discussion about checking billing/payment history to verify ad spend. rohan boosted an ad earlier and yogita confirms it was setup. discussion about traffic campaigns vs. boosting. consideration of running ads on existing instagram videos. yogita is exploring running ads on instagram only.", "performance marketing strategy & budget allocation: discussion of a performance marketing campaign with a budget of 3 lakhs. varun asks how to scale the campaign from zero with a fresh account and no transaction history. rohan asks about the initial milestone – aiming for 10,000 daily spend. discussion about the split between omnipresent (awareness) and conversion-led campaigns. varun asks how to allocate the budget between meta and google. rohan asks about the scaling strategy – when to increase spend to 15,000, 20,000, 30,000, 25,000. discussion about starting with either meta or google first. rohan emphasizes the importance of getting the strategy తీసుకోవడం right from the beginning. varun will develop a complete funnel and campaign plan. emphasis on the need for experimentation and regular campaign optimization. rohan asks for a detailed explanation of the campaign planning process. discussion of the gtm (go-to-market) strategy.", "call conclusion & follow-ups: rohan asked gayatri to inform yogita about the stand-up time discussion. rohan confirmed he already spoke with yogita. the call was concluded with thanks.", "commercial discussion & budget: rohan outlines a budget range of 15k-35k per month for ugc content creation. they've previously onboarded creators at both ends of this range. they are aiming for a six-month contract, potentially extending to a longer term. the desired contract value is around 1.8-2 lakh for 60 videos.