etings independently. discussion of the onboarding process and the importance of clear communication. rohan highlighted the need for the new hire to quickly grasp the project context.", "daily routine & stand-up meetings: rohan outlines the daily routine, including two core stand-up meetings (11:15 am and 6:00 pm). separate tech stand-ups are conducted due to departmental differences. a growth stand-up is held at 8:00 pm, catering to intern availability. the new hire will initially shadow rohan in stand-up meetings. rohan emphasizes the importance of understanding the project and being able to answer basic questions. the goal is to transition the new hire into a position where they can lead stand-up meetings independently. discussion of the onboarding process and the importance of clear communication.", "daily routine & stand-up meetings: rohan outlines the daily routine including two core stand-up meetings at 11:15 am and 6:00 pm. separate tech stand-ups are conducted due to departmental differences. a growth stand-up is held at 8:00 pm, catering to intern availability. harsh (new hire) will initially shadow rohan in stand-up meetings. rohan emphasizes the importance of understanding the project and being able to answer basic questions. the goal is to transition the new hire into a position where they can lead stand-up meetings independently. discussion of the onboarding process and the importance of clear communication. rohan highlighted the need for the new hire to quickly grasp the project context. repetition of the stand-up schedule (11:15 am, 6:00 pm, 8:00 pm) for clarity. emphasis on the intern shadowing rohan to learn the process. focus on the new hire's ability to independently lead stand-ups as the ultimate goal.", "specific content pieces & assets: discussion of a specific reel related to january 30th. mention of a “defrosting the glow” concept, possibly for a product or campaign. ideas for visuals, such as a face mist or travel-sized products. discussion