en's day content.\\n  • the team will meet tomorrow to brainstorm additional ideas for women's day and holy posts, acknowledging that approval for the holy post ideas previously shown by maryam and viraj is not guaranteed.\\n  • the team will create content for world ngo day, world wildlife day, holi, and international women's day.\\n\\n⚠️ Open Concerns:\\n  • confirming the reach and engagement of potential influencers.\\n  • uncertainty about the quality of instagram followers (are they potential buyers?).\\n  • the potential for ineffective ad targeting if relying solely on instagram's algorithm.\\n  • concern about whether the current instagram followers are likely to convert into buyers.\\n  • difficulty in converting instagram followers into buyers.\\n  • the need to maintain a consistent brand aesthetic on social media.\\n  • need to confirm the number of influencers to add.\\n  • ensuring content aligns with brand vibe and aesthetics.\\n  • need for clear communication and collaboration between ishneet and gayatri.\\n  • ensuring sahil understands the pristyn care brand aesthetic before starting any work.\\n  • ensuring janvi understands the brand's products and ingredients.\\n  • pressure to generate enough content options.\\n  • ensuring the images are visually appealing and consistent with the brand\\n  • ensuring all team members are aligned on content strategy.\\n  • need to ensure content is visually appealing and engaging.\\n  • aligning sahil's skills with pristyn care's diverse design approach.\\n  • ensuring a clear understanding of the campaign goals and expectations.\\n  • ensuring consistency across the content calendar (addressed by using yogita's calendar as a base).\\n  • the team needs to adapt their product strategy to reflect the 80/20 male/female spending split.\\n  • potential delays in social media campaign if tasks aren't completed on time.\\n  • there's a need to explore male-specific product categories to cater to the dominant male customer base.\\n  • harsh missing the evening stand-up and resulting miscommunication.\\n  • dependence on yashpal completing the photo upload before proceeding with other tasks.\\n  • potential reliance on outdated inspiration sources (pinterest).\\n\\n📋 Related Action Items:\\n  • yogita nagpal to analyze instagram follower profiles to assess their potential as future buyers. by Unspecified\\n  • yogita nagpal to yogita to perform håller influencer outreach. by today\\n  • yogita nagpal to focus on ugc content after influencer outreach.\\n  • yogita nagpal to analyze instagram follower profiles to assess potential for conversion. by Unspecified\\n  • yogita nagpal to yogita to work with isha on the social media aspect. by After Rohan and Dhruvik complete their work\\n  • yogita nagpal to contact rohan to discuss the instagram follower analysis. by Unspecified\\n  • yogita nagpal to yogita to finalize song selections for fragrance posts and share references in the group. by Unspecified\\n  • team (gayatri, sameera, yogita) to document brand activities (screenshots/videos) and share with the team. by Ongoing\\n  • sameera parveen to samira to add brands she's following to the content inspiration pool. by Tomorrow\\n  • yogita nagpal to introduce the 'pf.growthsupercharge.com' platform to the team. by Soon\\n  • yogita nagpal, gayatri ramdas to yogita and gayatri to discuss the website mock-up. by tomorrow\\n  • gayatri ramdas, yogita nagpal to gayatri and yogita to discuss the website mock-up. by Tomorrow\\n  • yogita nagpal to yogita to review content created by sameera and gayatri and make changes. by ASAP\\n  • sameera parveen to sameera to continue adding nano and micro influencers, aiming for approximately 20 total. by ASAP\\n  • team to explore incorporating a social cause into content strategy. by TBD\\n  • team (sameera, viraj, mariam) to create stories for world wildlife day and world ngo day. by Today\\n  • team (maryam, sameera) to complete content creati