ct categories: body oil and body mist.\\n  • The influencer requested two stories and two reels.\\n  • Discussion about specific effects for the influencer content.\\n  • Yogita proposed an 'unboxing' story as a standard for all influencers.\\n  • The idea is to create a highlight reel with community reposts.\\n  • Yogita suggested a story highlighting the products.\\n  • Rohan will include these suggestions in the final email to the influencer.\\n  • The influencer is from South India.\\n  • Rohan will send the influencer the requested information.\\n\\n[28:46 - 31:22] 📌 Content Creation & Team Updates\\n  👥 Key participants: Rohan Kumar, Yogita Nagpal, Dhruvik Bamniya\\n  • Interviewed a content writer named Shubham.\\n  • Considering Shubham for the role.\\n  • Mariam will be unavailable from tomorrow until March 19th due to exams.\\n  • Dhruvik will take over content creation tasks.\\n  • Interns' content is not working out.\\n  • Dhruvik will create a few posts and ideas.\\n  • Goal is to finish content up to March 17th.\\n  • Discussion about the content calendar and progress.\\n  • Rohan will follow up on dashboard progress.\\n  • Harsh is occupied with the dashboard and will connect on ad setup later.\\n  • Yogita will share audience information for ad boosting.\\n  • Yogita will share a link to the post for boosting.\\n  • Rohan will explore ad setup options.\\n\\n================================================================================\\n📊 ENGAGEMENT METRICS\\n================================================================================\\nTotal Utterances: 169\\nMost Active: Dhruvik Bamniya\\n\\nOverall Sentiment: 😟 Negative\\n\\n================================================================================\\nGenerated: 2026-02-12T13:34:37.952614\\n================================================================================"}	2026-02-12 13:35:11.724057	2026-02-12 13:35:11.724057
