llenges of finalizing website content and the need for effective communication."]}, "sentiment_analysis": {"score": 1, "overall": "positive", "negative_indicators": 0, "positive_indicators": 2}}, "metadata": {"date": "2026-02-12", "title": "Design Team Standup", "participants": ["Aakarshi Bhawsar", "Dhruvik Bamniya", "Gayatri Ramdas", "Niladri Bhattacharya", "Ruchy Priya", "Yogita Nagpal"], "transcript_path": "/root/transcriptor/meetingassistant/transcripts/merged/2026-02-12_18-30_design-team-standup__meet-recording-9c4113a9-7707-4438-8e43-c71a070ac560.json", "duration_minutes": 31}, "video_url": "http://pfvideos.growthsupercharged.com/web/index.html#!/details?id=22b884916f1c513c1d957e95c3ea866f", "generated_at": "2026-02-12T13:56:52.284548", "formatted_report": "================================================================================\\n🧠 MEETING ANALYSIS REPORT\\n================================================================================\\n\\n📋 Title: Design Team Standup\\n📅 Date: 2026-02-12\\n⏱️ Duration: 31 minutes\\n👥 Participants: Aakarshi Bhawsar, Dhruvik Bamniya, Gayatri Ramdas, Niladri Bhattacharya, Ruchy Priya, Yogita Nagpal\\n\\n================================================================================\\n📚 HISTORICAL CONTEXT\\n================================================================================\\n\\n🧠 Prior Decisions:\\n  • aaheli will provide both a pdf and the ai file of the brand card design to the printer. (context: to accommodate potential requests for special effects like spot uv)\\n  • gayatri will follow up with akash regarding the typography and paragraph breaks in the bifold design; akash has already begun making corrections.\\n  • aaheli will create 3-4 versions of the brand card design: red/red, red/beige, with and without the 'pristine forest' logo, and one with green. (context: exploring different color combinations and logo variations)\\n  • dhruvik will text the design group to request focused effort on image 