efore proceeding. the team needs to ensure that all label cutouts and barcodes are prepared for upload.", "content creation & alignment: rohan mentioning his work on content creation and checking intern content. rohan adding references for ruchi and radhika's posts due to creative misalignment. discussion of influencer responses and potential collaborations. yogita sharing updates on influencer outreach. discussion of the need to create a list of influencers, their commercial rates, and profiles. emphasis on ugc (user-generated content) and human element in content. discussion of content quality and its alignment with the brand. discussion of the need to create content that resonates with the target audience.", "image generation & watermarks: rohan asks if generated images have a google logo/watermark. dhruvik confirms that images downloaded from the premium version do not have a watermark. explanation of how the premium version of the image generator removes watermarks. rohan clarifies that the free version of the image generator includes a watermark. dhruvik confirms that he has not seen any watermarks on downloaded images. the team expresses relief that they do not need to remove watermarks from the images.", "image classification & clip model: rohan kumar mentioned finding clip as an image classifier. discussion of whether automation tools or orchestrators are needed for image classification. clip is described as a zero-shot image classifier model. rohan kumar suggests testing clip before committing to more complex solutions. chayan roy asks if anyone is interested in working with image classifier models. rohan kumar suggests initially keeping the image classification project small and self-contained. decision to involve the team later, after initial testing and validation. rohan kumar wants to create a project and ask for volunteers once the initial work is done. the goal is to explore image classification without immediately burdening the team. discussion abou