xpects more by 8 pm. she plans to interview 2-3 people for the intern positions. yogita has reached out to 10-12 influencers. some influencers are interested in paid collaborations and have standard rates. she'll share details with interested influencers after the design stand-up. yogita had a call with the interns regarding the content calendar. they aim to complete 80% of the next 17 days' content by tomorrow. remaining content will focus on women's day posts, expected to be completed by thursday. discussion about social media research – monitoring brands' posts for inspiration. focus is currently on story content, as other posts are often ugc or short-form. they are gathering ideas for the content calendar. yogita is looking for the interns to manage specific posts to gain experience.", "intern outreach and interview process: yogita provides an update on intern outreach. she has scheduled an interview for tomorrow with one candidate. two more candidates have had their work reviewed and are being scheduled for interviews on monday. two additional candidates have been sent assignments and are expected to submit them by the weekend. if these candidates submit assignments, interviews will be scheduled for them on monday as well. the team will decide on hires on monday based on the interviews. discussion of the timeline for the intern hiring process. emphasis on efficiently processing applications and scheduling interviews. yogita is actively managing the intern application pipeline. the team is aiming to quickly fill intern positions. focus on evaluating candidates based on their work and interview performance.", "content creation & team updates: interviewed a content writer named shubham. considering shubham for the role. mariam will be unavailable from tomorrow until march 19th due to exams. dhruvik will take over content creation tasks. interns' content is not working out. dhruvik will create a few posts and ideas. goal is to finish content up to march 17th. discussion about the content calendar and progress. rohan will follow up on dashboard progress. harsh is occupied with the dashboard and will connect on ad setup later. yogita will share audience information for ad boosting. yogita will share a link to the post for boosting. rohan will explore ad setup options.", "intern interviews & application review: rohan mentions scheduling interviews for interns who have applied. yogita notes that most applicants didn't submit sample work as requested, only two (shubham and sakina) did. yogita emailed applicants requesting the missing sample work. harsh mentions muskan's submitted work lacks effort. discussion of checking applicant submissions and prioritizing those with work. confirmation that no interviews are currently scheduled. focus on ensuring applicants provide the requested sample work before scheduling interviews.", "intern content creation & skill assessment: gayatri requests yogita to provide writing references from sakina and other decent interns. the focus is on assessing the interns' content creation skills. gayatri is seeking to identify interns who can produce quality content. the conversation suggests a need to evaluate the interns' writing abilities. yogita is tasked with identifying interns with potential for content creation. the discussion implies a desire to improve the quality of content created by the interns.", "intern hiring & application review: yogita reviewed intern applications. most applications were not impressive. a few promising candidates were identified. yogita sent emails to 5-6 candidates, requesting writing samples. emphasis on assessing writing skills as a key requirement. yogita used her personal email to contact applicants. discussion about assessing the quality of previous work submitted by applicants.", "intern management and content ownership: rohan asks yogita if the interns are ready to manage their own posts. the plan is to assign a portion of the 17-day content calendar to individual interns. the goal is to give interns ownership and responsibility for specific posts. rohan wants the interns to handle all aspects of their assigned posts, including explanations and details. yogita confirms that the interns have been working on individual posts. rohan asks if the interns are comfortable taking ownership of the entire process for their assigned posts. the idea is to give interns a chance to learn and grow by taking full responsibility for their work. discussion about the level of support and guidance the interns will need to succeed. the goal is to empower the interns and give them the opportunity to showcase their skills.", "intern collaboration & design stand-up: yogita asked vedika to join the design stand-up to brief akarshi. goal is to have intern-to-intern mapping for content creation. yogita wants interns to eventually contribute to production, not just conceptualization. vedika and maryam are already involved, viraj rajan and sameera are next. gayatri and yogita will join the design stand-up. discussion of how much guidance the interns need. contingency plan if interns aren't able to contribute. harsh confirming akarshi's post from february 17th is good to go. discussion of the intern's skillset and how to best utilize them. emphasis on giving the interns the opportunity to learn and grow.", "detailed documentation process & expectations: gayatri requests interns to create a weekly sheet documenting their observations of followed brands. the sheet should include the date, week, and specific insights about each brand. emphasis on noting *why* certain content is effective or ineffective. the goal is to create a detailed record of competitor strategies and aesthetic preferences. maryam is asked to guide other interns in the documentation process, leveraging her experience. gayatri wants interns to go beyond simply reporting *what* brands are posting and articulate their *thoughts* and *feelings* about the content. the documentation should in