rticipants: Rohan Kumar, Ginish Garg\\n  • Rohan Kumar asked Ginish about presenting a paper this week.\\n  • Ginish confirmed availability for a presentation this week.\\n  • They agreed to discuss the presentation content beforehand.\\n  • Rohan Kumar will ping Ginish tomorrow morning to schedule the discussion.\\n  • The presentation is a key communication point.\\n  • The goal is to have a productive discussion before the presentation.\\n\\n[04:23 - 05:33] 📌 CF Growth Supercharge - Percentage Update\\n  👥 Key participants: Shubhang Mishra\\n  • Shubhang Mishra mentioned a 2% addition to CF growth supercharge.\\n  • There was a brief discussion about the location of this update (PS2).\\n  • The team confirmed the update was added to the correct section.\\n  • This is a minor update related to growth metrics.\\n  • The update seems to be related to a specific feature or campaign.\\n  • The team is tracking key growth metrics.\\n\\n[05:34 - 06:46] 📌 Call Conclusion\\n  👥 Key participants: Rohan Kumar\\n  • Rohan Kumar asked if anyone had anything else to discuss.\\n  • No further topics were raised.\\n  • Rohan Kumar concluded the call.\\n  • The call was brief and focused on key updates.\\n  • The team seems to be on track with their deliverables.\\n\\n================================================================================\\n⚙️ KEY DECISIONS\\n================================================================================\\n1. Ginish will present a paper on Wednesday or Thursday.\\n2. Rohan will ping Ginish tomorrow morning to schedule a presentation discussion.\\n3. Rohan will show website comparison work next time (unspecified date).\\n4. Shubhang will aim to complete backend wiring for the manager part by the night stand-up.\\n5. Rohan will review Shubhang’s work and provide feedback.\\n6. Rohan acknowledged Shubhang resolved errors in admin and teams related to role/department assignment.\\n7. Agreement to conclude the call if no further discussion p