rket research to understand the target audience.", "influencer identification & vetting: samira shares a sheet of potential influencers. yogita asks samira to arrange influencers in the sheet and indicate those already contacted. discussion of removing influencers from the list who have already been reached out to. ouvoir of jhanvi (ugc influencer) and concerns about her profile being 'polished' enough. yogita plans to discuss jhanvi's profile further. discussion of an influencer named 'cogc' and a screenshot samira sent. evaluation of an influencer's follower count – samira emphasizes quality over quantity. the team discusses the importance of genuine effort in influencer content. discussion of an influencer who has collaborated with foxtail and nextface. evaluation of an influencer’s video quality and content type (application reels vs. ugc). concern that some influencers only create unboxing/review content, not ugc. yogita and gayatri debate the type of content an influencer can deliver. emphasis on understanding an influencer's niche and content style.", "influencer collaboration - soma girl: dhruvik mentioned connecting with an influencer. the influencer has agreed to collaborate. the influencer requested references of the kind of video she can generate. yogita showed rohan the influencer's profile (soma girl). the influencer suggested focusing on two product categories: body oil and body mist. the influencer requested two stories and two reels. discussion about specific effects for the influencer content. yogita proposed an 'unboxing' story as a standard for all influencers. the idea is to create a highlight reel with community reposts. yogita suggested a story highlighting the products. rohan will include these suggestions in the final email to the influencer. the influencer is from south india. rohan will send the influencer the requested information.", "dhruvik update & link sharing: rohan will connect with dhruvik at 6 pm to get an update. dhruvik is respo