n.", "Rohan offers assistance with resolving technical difficulties."], "end_time": "49:46", "start_time": "48:37", "time_range": "48:37 - 49:46", "participants": ["Rohan Kumar", "Sanjeev Jain"]}, {"topic": "Project Timeline & Deliverables", "points": ["Rohan asks Sanjeev to provide a timeline for project completion.", "Sanjeev requests time to study the app property and identify gaps before defining a timeline.", "Rohan agrees and sets a deadline of the end of March for Sanjeev to finalize a plan.", "Discussion about the importance of defining clear deliverables and milestones.", "Rohan emphasizes the need for Sanjeev to be prepared and proactive.", "Sanjeev explains the need for research and gap analysis before starting design.", "Rohan asks Sanjeev to finalize a plan by the end of March.", "Discussion about the importance of a well-defined timeline for project success."], "end_time": "51:45", "start_time": "49:47", "time_range": "49:47 - 51:45", "participants": ["Rohan Kumar", "Sanjeev Jain"]}, {"topic": "Expectations & Communication", "points": ["Rohan expresses excitement about working with Sanjeev.", "Sanjeev expresses excitement about the project and the Jax process.", "Rohan reiterates the importance of Sanjeev being prepared and proactive.", "Discussion about the importance of clear communication and collaboration.", "Rohan emphasizes the need for Sanjeev to define a timeline and deliverables.", "Sanjeev explains the need for research and gap analysis before starting design.", "Rohan asks Sanjeev to finalize a plan by the end of March.", "Discussion about the importance of a well-defined timeline for project success."], "end_time": "53:38", "start_time": "51:47", "time_range": "51:47 - 53:38", "participants": ["Rohan Kumar", "Sanjeev Jain"]}], "concerns": [], "next_steps": ["Rohan Kumar to Rohan to resend Notion invitation to Sanjeev. by Immediately", "Sanjeev to Sanjeev to explore the project and identify areas for improvement. by Ongoing", "Sanjeev to San