ot being able to get something, leading to the creation of a floor diagram.", "maintaining a clear distinction between influencers and ugc creators.", "ensuring the scalability and future-proofness of the chosen approach.", "potential for miscommunication or lack of clarity regarding vedika's ideas (though not explicitly stated, the follow-up suggests a need to confirm understanding).", "the snippet implies a general concern about the quality of internship applicants, as the discussion focuses on confirming muskan as a 'fit' suggesting others may not be.", "ensuring proper coordination between rohan and yashpal.", "ganesh's progress on internship applications and professor outreach.", "ensuring the new team member is properly onboarded and given meaningful work.", "esha was unsure about how the data was structured and needed clarification.", "concern about the project being ready for a demonstration in a timely manner.", "coordination needed between ganesh and shubhang to add tasks", "potential need for training or support for harsh to effectively manage the new platforms and apis.", "uncertainty about the timeline for completing website comparison work", "doubts about content created by viraj."], "prior_decisions": ["yogita will attempt to generate a visual in freepik for the carousel post.", "yogita will share common design links (linkedin post file, canva carousel file) in the design group.", "social media calendar planning will proceed weekly (starting 22-29th), with yogita sharing the calendar in the group.", "yogita and gayatri will complete visuals for the website (timeline unspecified).", "yogita will share a list of important dates (for potential posts) with the team.", "gayatri and yogita will connect at 7:30 to discuss the website visuals.", "they agreed to involve yogita in the selection process for the new social media assistant.", "the team acknowledged the need to move beyond limiting the post to just four archetypes and to include more representation.", "muskan is encouraged to attend design stand-ups to explore design as a potential career path.", "vedika will join the design stand-up to brief dravik regarding the post and clarify any doubts.", "rนอกhan will provide the design team with access to adobe firefly via existing and new email accounts, allocating subscriptions as needed.", "the team will discuss post ideas (holy & ganesh) with interns and finalize a design.", "the team agreed to expand the range of archetypes beyond the initial four to be more inclusive and representative of a wider audience.", "the team agreed to experiment with using puffy in content, potentially with a 'one minute ritual' concept.", "rohan kumar will research a solution for akarshhan's api documentation/event definition problem and provide an update by tomorrow evening's stand-up.", "rohan will brief sanjeev on ui/ux aspects starting monday.", "the team decided to discuss the holi post design in the design group to ensure input is captured.", "rohan will focus on android app development and explore ios sideloading options.", "rohan will secure a subscription for davinci resolve and determine project scope with the design team.", "gayatri will attend a stand-up meeting with the rest of the team, likely to discuss intern progress or related tasks. the specific purpose of the stand-up isn't detailed in this snippet but is established as a planned event.", "rohan acknowledges a need to build buffer time into project timelines, starting with a 3-5 day buffer instead of waiting until the last day for edits.", "gayatri suggested using ai to generate content ideas for the coming week, noting a shift in brand approaches towards raw and organic content.", "gayatri will provide a sample script for influencers to understand the flow of content, but won't fully write their scripts.", "the growth stand-up meeting will proceed as scheduled, but rohan needs to complete the dashboard work beforehand.", "rohan will share shopify dashboard access with ayush for the 8 pm stand-up.", "harsh will potentially take over the dashboard creation if rohan is unable to complete the work.", "rohan will sit with isha today to finalize the social media dashboard and address outstanding issues.", "the team will move forward with the social media dashboard once rohan completes the enf column and other necessary updates.", "犢 rohan and harsh will connect today at 2 pm to discuss dashboard progress with the group.", "apurva will connect tomorrow regarding the content writer internship. rohan will review applications from apurva and shubham to decide who to hire.", "yogita, gayatri, and potentially rohan will discuss a project with an unnamed individual (likely a new team member) to give him ownership of a 'signature project' (likely the artist collaboration).", "the team will discuss women's day ideas in the design stand-up on february 19th at 6:30 pm."], "meeting_segments": ["design stand-up coordination & briefing: yogita requested vedika to join the design stand-up. the purpose of vedika's attendance was to brief dravik (likely a team member) and address any questions he might have. yogita emphasized the need for clear communication and ensuring dravik had all the necessary information. vedika confirmed she had the link to the design stand-up and would share it again. the goal was to ensure smooth collaboration and prevent any misunderstandings. yogita wanted to ensure dravik had a clear understanding of the project's requirements. emphasis on proactive communication and addressing potential issues before they arise.", "carousel post visuals & content creation: discussion about the second slide for the carousel post. the second slide should feature images of all six body mists (and potentially travel sizes). yogita will attempt to generate the visuals on freepik. concern about the availability of backup visuals if freepik generation fails. gayatri and yogita are currently working on visuals for the website. uncertainty about the completion timeline for the website visuals. yogita requested references/images from dhruvik to aid in visual creation. dhruvik agreed to share references. discussion about the urgency of the carousel post visuals. agreement to connect at 7:30 pm to discuss the website visuals. emphasis on the need for a visual showing all body mists. concern about the lack of a backup plan if freepik fails.", "website visuals & coordination: gayatri and yogita are responsible for creating visuals for the website. uncertainty about the completion date for the website visuals. coordination to connect at 7:30 pm to discuss the website visuals. the website visuals are a priority. the need to prioritize the website visuals alongside the carousel post. discussion about the overall timeline for the website project. emphasis on the importance of clear communication regarding the website visuals. the website visuals are dependent on the completion of other tasks. discussion of resource allocation for the website project. the need to manage expectations regarding the website visuals.", "follow-up on existing tasks & action items: gayatri mentions she will share something with yogita today. yogita will share a design standard with gayatri. confirmation of ongoing tasks and action items. discussion of deadlines and responsibilities. emphasis on keeping tasks on track. confirmation of shared responsibilities. follow-up on previously discussed items. confirmation of ongoing collaboration. discussion of timelines and deliverables. confirmation of ongoing communication. emphasis on maintaining momentum. confirmation of shared goals. discussion of progress and challenges.", "onboarding & team coordination: discussion about onboarding a new ui/ux designer. the designer will join next week; rohan may not be available to guide her. dhruvik offered to brief the designer or provide contact info for rohan. the designer will be assigned the dashboard project (long-term, 2-3 months). discussion of gayathri's travel schedule and coordination for handover. rohan will connect with ishpal to review progress. rohan will connect with yashpal to explain the asset organization. rohan's limited availability next week due to network access issues. emphasis on clear communication and handover documentation.", "meeting logistics & attendance check-in: yogita notes vedika and virat are unavailable due to studio commitments and a road issue, respectively. maryam has exams and is therefore unavailable. sameera is present and has joined the call. initial greetings and check-in between participants. discussion about who is presenting updates (samira is the sole presenter for the day). brief mention of sunita and a quick greeting. confirmation of sameera being the sole presenter. discussion of viraj’s absence and tagging gayatri in relevant discussions. clarification on how tagging and notifications work on mattermost. rohan acknowledges forgetting to tag gayatri and corrects it. confirmation that gayatri receives email notifications with tags. brief discussion about rohan’s usual practice of tagging. acknowledgement of yogita’s presence and a quick greeting.", "content calendar & initial meeting setup: discussion about finalizing the content calendar. yogita suggests samira and rohan connect for a 15-minute call to discuss the content calendar. the goal is to finish a table related to the content calendar. yogita asks samira to ping her once the table is added. acknowledgement of yogita potentially being late for another commitment. samira asks avitha if she sent the meeting link earlier. two meetings are identified: one previously created and a 'marketing and content stand-up' meeting. yogita explains she isn't on the 5 pm meeting. gayatri confirms. yogita explains the previous meeting invite was deleted from the calendar. yogita created the 'marketing and content stand-up' meeting because she should be available for that one. yogita offers to add rohan to her meeting and delete the old one. confirmation of a 6 pm connection between yogita and rohan.", "ruchi's font revision & saturday work: saivaibhav inquired about ruchi's progress on font revisions. ruchi confirmed she has made the changes and will share a video of the printout tonight. discussion of ruchi's work schedule on saturdays. ruchi confirmed she has started working and will send the first draft tonight or tomorrow.", "website mock-up discussion & vedika involvement: discussion about reducing the size of a url for the website. gayatri suggests having 'coming soon' in one line with smaller font size. dhruvik suggests both elements remain centered. gayatri confirms informing someone (presumably vedika) about something related to the website mock-up. yogita acknowledges vedika previously had ideas about the mock-up. discussion implies a prior discussion about vedika's input. gayatri will get vedika's thoughts on the mock-up. this is a follow-up action from prior decisions (gayatri to text vedika). no specific details of vedika’s ideas are shared. discussion about the website launch being dependent on the website mock-up. three posts (one static, one linkedin, one reel) are awaiting the website mock-up. confirmation that other posts have already been assigned. question about the status of the website mock-up. yogita asked how many posts are dependent on the website mock-up. gayatri clarified that three posts are dependent on the website mock-up.", "muskan's design skills and interests: gayatri asks about muskan's canva experience and whether she creates designs or just writes content. muskan confirms she does both content writing and graphic design. gayatri inquires about muskan’s subject in school, learning she is studying science (pcb). discussion of muskan's interest in both writing and design, and her willingness to explore both areas. muskan expresses her desire to learn and contribute to different teams within the company. gayatri highlights the opportunity for muskan to e